OL,3,GNEWSAFirm fined #1m after man killed by
OL,4,Afalling window
OL,5,
OL,6,FA property developer has been fined #1m
OL,7,Fafter a window fell from a luxury
OL,8,Friverside penthouse in south London and
OL,9,Fkilled a coach driver.
OL,11,FMick Ferris, 53, was crushed when the
OL,12,Fpane of glass weighing 130kg (20
OL,13,Fstones) fell 26 storeys from The
OL,14,FCorniche in Vauxhall on 2 October 2018.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
