OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFirm fined #1m after man killed by
OL,4,Afalling window
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis wife Rachel Ferris, told the
OL,7,Fsentencing hearing at Inner London
OL,8,FCrown Court that her husband's death
OL,9,F"could have been prevented", after it
OL,10,Femerged that a window fell from the
OL,11,Fsame development in August 2017, but
OL,12,Fthe design was not substantially
OL,13,Fchanged as a result.
OL,15,FPrashant Popat KC said the developer St
OL,16,FJames Group Ltd was "deeply remorseful
OL,17,Fand regretful".
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
